# Back office prototype (src/backoffice/). See README, "Back office".
#
# `pnpm backoffice` needs nothing here: without a login it makes one up for
# the run and prints it. Set these two for a login that stays the same.
# The hash comes from: pnpm backoffice:password "<password>"
#
# BACKOFFICE_USER=you@example.com
# BACKOFFICE_PASSWORD_HASH=scrypt:16384:8:1:…
